  "packageHash": "f7fr9vLSZQrnCVz+NCH/ajEsobNm5itrTYmxy9dPUFmytmOSa1AFqocmLGUeCSKebPtKVUCILObZf+Bo4ChG4Q==",
  "packageHashAlgorithm": "SHA512",
  "packageSize": 356617,
  "projectUrl": "https://github.com/BisocM/CQRSharp",
  "published": "2026-09-26T01:26:35.21Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Version 5.0.0 (breaking). The pipeline pack is removed: each builder verb registers its own behavior, and both forms of AddCqrsGenerated register validation and exception handling unless UseValidation(false) / UseExceptionHandling(false) turns them off.\n            Idempotency replays the original result, rejects a key reused with another payload (IdempotencyKeyMismatchException) and covers streams. The unit-of-work behaviors run on IUnitOfWork and roll back a returned failed CommandResult.\n            UseTimeout throws RequestTimeoutException, and retries stop only at the caller's own cancellation and the library's verdicts. RateLimiter is now RequestRateLimiter and RateLimiterOptions is RateLimitingOptions.\n            See https://github.com/BisocM/CQRSharp/blob/v5.0.0/CHANGELOG.md for the full notes and the upgrade steps from 4.2.1.",
